  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following halides will be most reactive in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mn>1</mn></math> reaction and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></math> reactions, respectively<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0030_eff0a99d56d7.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:4.89167in;height:1.975in\" />"
